flowchart TB
  P[PENDING] -->|Assign Attempt| A[ACTIVE]
  P -->|Expired before start| E[EXPIRED]
  A -->|Confirmed result| DONE["SUCCEEDED / FAILED"]
  A -->|Request cancel| C[CANCEL_REQUESTED]
  A -->|Uncertain effect or timeout| R[RECONCILING]
  C -->|Confirmed stop| STOP[CANCELED]
  C -->|Confirmed result| DONE
  C -->|Stop or effect unresolved| R
  R -->|Confirmed result| DONE
  R -->|Confirmed stop| STOP
  R -->|Reconciled safe retry| P
